<Layout title="Uses — Ashish Gautam" description="The hardware, software, and tools I use day-to-day.">
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">/uses</p>
    <h1>What I use.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      The hardware, software, and tools that make it through my day.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Hardware</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Laptop</strong> — Macbook Air M1 since 2020</li>
      <li><strong>Display</strong> — LG 27UP850K 68.4 cm with iVOOMi Power Arm and Quntis Computer Monitor Lamp</li>
      <li><strong>Keyboard</strong> — Keychron K8 Pro</li>
      <li><strong>Mouse</strong> —MX master 3s</li>
      <li><strong>Headphones</strong> — Airpods pro 2</li>

    </ul>

    <h2>Editor & terminal</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Editor</strong> — Visual Studio Code with Catpuccino mocha theme</li>
      <li><strong>Terminal</strong> — iTerm2 + zsh</li>
      <li><strong>Font</strong> — Firacode</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Software I rely on</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Placeholder note-taking app</li>
      <li>Placeholder browser + extensions</li>
      <li>Placeholder password manager</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section muted">
    <p>
      Inspired by <a href="https://uses.tech">uses.tech</a>. Updated whenever something
      in this list changes — which isn't often.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
